network-manager-ms-sso (2.0.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Batch Microsoft UI detection to make first-time authentication substantially faster
  * Adapt across password, passkey, number-match, method-picker, and TOTP variations
  * Confirm password dispatch and never replay sensitive authentication actions
  * Repair stalled AnyConnect browser profiles before one isolated clean-session retry
  * Give AnyConnect profiles a 360-second NetworkManager activation-timeout floor
  * Pass complete AnyConnect cookies through an anonymous in-memory config
  * Detect owned AnyConnect tunnels independently of localized console output
  * Authorize the correlated Microsoft-to-UniBas password transition securely
  * Preserve GlobalProtect browser, HIP/OS, cookie, timeout, and tunnel behavior
  * Restore physical routes and DNS after failed, cancelled, or timed-out VPN attempts
  * Require OpenConnect 9.12 or newer consistently on every package format

